# Operator additions

Follow `docs/operators/WORKFLOW.md`. One spec file per operator. Own only
that operator's generator, unit test, and `tests/<prefix>_*.sql` pair.

Register the name in `excalidraw.generator.ts`. Unknown names already fall
back to red `unimplemented` via `DefaultNodeGenerator`.

Verify with `./scripts/verify-operator.sh <prefix>` before the full suite.
